      "comment": "Canon: Moon Sisters and the Moon Prison",
      "content": "Nibelung made three moon goddesses: Aria (Eternal Moon), Canon (Frost Moon) and Sonnet (Iridescent Moon). When he returned from the Abyss he interned them in the moon's reflection and made their moons into weapons. Souls and divinity are kept there, not bodies, which is why Columbina could leave a fragment of her soul behind and later return. Two moons were broken by the Heavenly Principles and the Frost Moon was thrown beyond the false sky.",
