      "key": [
        "Huurrekuutar",
        "Prusmene"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Canon: Huurrekuutar and Prusmene",
      "content": "Huurrekuutar is the Frostmoon Scions' name for Canon; a hymn in Hymns of the Far North calls her mother of holy light and of the silver shuttle. Prusmene is the name in a chanson of a boatman of Arcadia, a believer who prayed to her as ancient mother of the night and mistress of the Golden Hall. Both titles are generally read as the same goddess.",
