      "comment": "Canon: Antler Crowns of the Moonchanters",
      "content": "Item text says legend holds that the antler crowns of Moonchanters were a gift of the Frost Moon at the moment of its destruction. When the silver tree was splintered and the priesthood begged for new coronals, the goddess out of pity wove crowns of flawless moonlight that came with their birth. The last Archpriestess, Lovia, chose to forge a circlet from iron rather than rely on this gift.",
