      "comment": "Canon: Hyperborea and the Celestial Nails",
      "content": "Canon was horrified by the Celestial Nails with which the Heavenly Principles struck civilisations that tested their rules. She told Columbina she did everything she could to help the punished escape. Columbina thought the Frostmoon Scions' ancestors were among those she saved, and the wiki says Canon later guided Hyperborea's survivors to Hiisi Island.",
